# Keeps the build context small and free of local state. The Dockerfile copies an explicit set of files, so anything
# excluded here is simply never sent to the build. lib/test and lib/scripts are left out on purpose: neither is part
# of the signed release manifest and the runtime never loads either — excluding them also keeps the container's
# self-attest perfectly clean (it reports the signed set with no stray "extra file" to explain).
.git
.github
.claude
node_modules
**/node_modules
src-tauri
lib/test
lib/scripts
.test-data
docs/BACKLOG.md
docs/TEAM-VAULTS-DESIGN.md
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
